Sub LoadCoreFiles
	On Error Resume Next
	ExecuteGlobal GetTextFile("core.vbs")   'still needed for vpmTimer, DOF consts, cvpmMagnet
	If Err Then MsgBox "Can\'t open core.vbs"
	On Error GoTo 0
